}

### 21. Cadastrar Entrega 1 (Data: 25/10/2026 - Carga 1)
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "cidade": "Florianópolis",
    "status": "TRANSITO",
    "data": "2026-10-25",
    "hora": "14:00:00",
    "idCarga": 1
}

### 22. Cadastrar Entrega 2 (Data: 05/10/2026 - Carga 2)
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "cidade": "Curitiba",
    "status": "ENTREGUE",
    "data": "2026-10-05",
    "hora": "10:30:00",
    "idCarga": 2
}

### 23. Cadastrar Entrega 3 (Data: 15/10/2026 - Carga 3)
