### 24. Cadastrar Entrega com status inválido (Deve retornar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "cidade": "São Paulo",
    "status": "PERDIDA",
    "data": "2026-10-20",
    "hora": "09:00:00",
    "idCarga": 1
}

### 25. Atualizar Entrega 1 (Altera status para ENTREGUE e data para 30/10/2026)
PUT http://localhost:3000/entrega/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "status": "ENTREGUE",
    "data": "2026-10-30",
    "hora": "15:30:00"
}

### 26. Atualizar Entrega Inexistente (Deve retornar erro 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/entrega/999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "status": "ENTREGUE"
}

### 27. Listar Entregas Ordenadas por Data (Deve retornar a ordem: 05/10, 15/10 e 30/10)
GET http://localhost:3000/entregas
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 28. Deletar Motorista Inexistente (Deve retornar 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/motorista/999
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 29. Deletar Motorista 3 (Roberto)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/motorista/3
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
